{"answer_text":"Connecting support to your CRM means agents see deal and account context on every ticket. Options that do this well: [1]\n\n- **Brightdesk Helpdesk**: Strong reporting and automations, though the interface feels dated. [2]\n- **Calmline**: A calm, fast shared inbox with collision detection and CRM sidebars. [3]\n- **Northwind CRM Service Desk**: Its service module links tickets to accounts, at enterprise prices. [4]\n\nIn short, if support is your main workflow, go with Brightdesk; otherwise Calmline keeps things simpler.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50ea-7351-83c0-cdfa35eebe0d","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:44.650Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["help desk crm integration","help desk with crm sync"],"latency_ms":5120,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[126,136],[469,479]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[225,233]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[314,327]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."}],"model":"perplexit